            "text": "{\"title\":\"Festive Shoyu Miso Roasted Duck with Sake Glaze\",\"readyInMinutes\":85,\"servings\":6,\"summary\":\"This \u003cb\u003efestive shoyu miso roasted duck\u003c/b\u003e brings an elegant centerpiece to your celebratory Japanese banquets and holiday gatherings. Whole roasted duck is a show-stopping dish symbolising prosperity and abundance, perfect for traditional New Year feasts or major family milestones. The duck is deeply seasoned with a fragrant combination of \u003cb\u003ered miso paste\u003c/b\u003e, premium junmai sake, dark soy sauce, and sweet mirin, balanced with a subtle hint of red plum preserve for balanced acidity and glossiness. Slow roasting creates remarkably crisp skin while rendering fat to keep the breast and thigh meat extraordinarily tender and succulent. Basting with pan dripping juices ensures rich umami flavor in every slice. Serve this masterpiece sliced thinly alongside warm steamed rice, charred scallions, and pickled ginger for a grand culinary experience. Rich in \u003cb\u003eprotein and iron\u003c/b\u003e, this elevated roast offers an irresistible blend of savory depth, delicate sweetness, and complex aromas that will impress every guest at your table.\",\"nutrition\":{\"nutrients\":[{\"name\":\"Calories\",\"amount\":520,\"unit\":\"kcal\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":26},{\"name\":\"Fat\",\"amount\":34,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":44},{\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"amount\":10,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":50},{\"name\":\"Carbohydrates\",\"amount\":18,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":6},{\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"amount\":12,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":13},{\"name\":\"Protein\",\"amount\":32,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":64},{\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"amount\":115,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":38},{\"name\":\"Sodium\",\"amount\":890,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":39},{\"name\":\"Fiber\",\"amount\":1.2,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":4},{\"name\"